Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||03-02-2001||03:16 PM||||David Letterman - hands down. Leno isn't even funny. Leno hates it when someone gets more laughs than he does - which isn't all that difficult (I can remember when he really got pissed off when he wanted to throw a guest into this small pool but the guest threw him in first). I love Letterman - watch it every single night. I like Conan O'Brien too. Have never seen Kilbourne though.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Cheever2||03-02-2001||03:31 PM||||I'm with you, Cliff.  <BR>But Kilborne is boring.<BR>I know Letterman is goofy, but he's so goofy it's funny.  He's being goofy on purpose, not because he's some idiot, but because it's a funny part of his personality.  That's why most people can't do that job, cause like me they would have to pretend, and not be genuine in a way that many people enjoy.<BR>Good topic.<P>||||reg||6
